KEY STRUCTURES AT A GLANCE
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

t_token:  Lexer output (linked list of tokens)
          ├─ type (WORD, PIPE, REDIR, etc.)
          ├─ value (actual string)
          └─ next/prev (doubly linked)

t_redir:  Redirection info
          ├─ type (IN, OUT, APPEND, HEREDOC)
          ├─ file (filename)
          └─ fd (file descriptor)

t_cmd:    Single command
          ├─ args (NULL-terminated array)
          ├─ redirs (linked list)
          └─ next (pipeline)

t_env:    Environment variable
          ├─ key (variable name)
          ├─ value (variable value)
          └─ next (linked list)

t_shell:  Global shell state
          ├─ env (environment list)
          ├─ envp (environment array)
          ├─ exit_status ($?)
          └─ stdin/stdout backups

